## Agent Selection
{{#hasAgentSelector}}
This project has automatic agent selection enabled. When you don't specify an agent,
the agent-selector will analyze your request and delegate to the appropriate specialist.

### How to use specific agents
If you want to use a specific agent, mention it in your request:
- "Using the react-component-builder agent, create a new component..."
- "As the postgres-dba agent, optimize this query..."

### Automatic selection
When you don't specify an agent, the agent-selector will:
1. Analyze your request
2. Identify the most suitable agent(s)
3. Delegate the task appropriately
